<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Khurahat Mau | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical timings for bike parcel shipment via train from Khurahat Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Bike parcels dispatched from Khurahat Mau on Indian Railways typically reach major hubs within 24‑48 hours, depending on the train’s route and priority class. Our coordination with railway cargo offices ensures that the bike is loaded on a dedicated parcel coach, and we provide real‑time updates on expected arrival times.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I book a train for bike transportation in Khurahat Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Booking a bike train parcel is simple: contact our Khurahat Mau office, provide bike details and preferred travel date, and we handle the reservation through the railway’s cargo portal. We secure the booking, generate the e‑Way bill, and share the PNR for you to track the shipment.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Why is Shree Ashirwad considered the best bike transport service in India for Khurahat Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our reputation stems from a 15‑year legacy, ISO‑9001:2015 quality standards, IBA‑approved billing, and a zero‑scratch guarantee using hydraulic ramp trailers. Coupled with live GPS tracking, 100 % declared‑value insurance, and over 22,000 successful moves, we consistently deliver the safest, most reliable bike transportation across India.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with bike transportation in Khurahat Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that offers 100 % declared value protection against loss, theft, or damage during transit. The policy is automatically activated at pickup, and we provide a detailed insurance certificate for your records.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any special precautions for transporting sports or custom motorcycles?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Sports and custom bikes receive custom‑fabricated wooden crates, vibration‑dampening foam pads, and reinforced wheel chocks. Our technicians also perform a pre‑move inspection, document existing scratches, and use anti‑slip ratchet lashings to secure the bike, ensuring it arrives in showroom condition.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike transportation from Khurahat Mau?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued ID, a signed consignment note, and the e‑Way bill generated by our team. For corporate or government moves, we also provide GST‑compliant invoices that are accepted for reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does live GPS tracking enhance the safety of my bike during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Live GPS tracking provides minute‑by‑minute location data, alerts us to any route deviation, and allows you to monitor progress via a mobile app. This transparency deters unauthorized handling, ensures adherence to the planned highway corridor, and enables rapid response if any issue arises.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
